{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださりありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 四期生 山田桃実(やまだももみ)です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は、台風がよく来てて天気が崩れてることが多く\nあとインフルエンザも流行り始めたらしく"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "え、もう夏終わった？となっています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "台風は結構気分屋なイメージなので読めないですよね、進路とかスピードとか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "難しい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私のイメージですが、夏といえば、青い空に真っ白い大きな入道雲、庭には緑が生い茂っていてセミが元気よく鳴いている"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "汗だくになるまで外で走り回ったり、暑いねーって言い合いながら部活したり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "シーブリーズさんにはよくお世話になったな~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あとは夏の定番、花火大会に行ったり、お祭りに行って屋台を楽しんだり、線香花火したり、かき氷食べたり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でもよくよく考えてみたら、私、今年夏らしいこと何もしてないなって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年は、ツアーの夏!!で初めて体験する夏でした\n新しい感覚で、楽しすぎて、あっという間で。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "んー、でもやっぱり私の想像する夏らしいこともしたい！って思って"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏、追いかけてみました\nもうひとつの夏を🍉"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私の追いかけた夏、まずは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobCVC3Gm.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "じゃーん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひまわり畑へ🌻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひまわりいっぱい咲いてるのかな、天気予報ちょっと怪しいな、って不安要素しかなかったけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひまわりいっぱい咲いてたし、天気も行った時だけ晴れてて！\n嬉しかった~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mob0SZ0Yh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobfUgM9Q.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobbrttbm.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobtpZ0qQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "写真フォルダ、ひまわりだらけ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あともうひとつ、私の写真フォルダを埋めつくしてるものがあって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mob9JjSKo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "パチパチ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そうです、手持ち花火です🎇"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "絶対にしようね、と友達とずっと前から約束してて\nたくさん花火しました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/moblCUisD.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この花火、綺麗だった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "光に寄ってくる、苦手な虫たちと戦いながら花火を楽しみました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "友達のズボンに大きめの虫が付いたときは、取ってあげるという考えは頭になく、急いで3mくらい離れました\nごめん。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やっぱり最後は、線香花火で締めました\n6本あったので、3回戦。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "友達と私、どっちが勝ったと思う？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2人とも、負けました、風に。\nすぐ、ぽとっって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来年またリベンジだな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ということで追いかけてみた夏も悪くなかった！\nというか夏×2で夏を満喫できました☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来年も、素敵な夏と出会えますように。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まずは、これから来る秋さんよろしく！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少しは涼しくなるのかな\n急に冬来たりして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それは勘弁ですよね、衣替えが追いつかないです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📢"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6th YEAR ANNIVERSARY LIVE"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・FC会員先行\n・Lemino スペシャルシート先行\n・Lemino櫻坂46パック先行"}, {"typ